,"kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000428","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m045-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000430","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p046","text":"悼公二年，齊臣田乞弒其君孺子，立其兄陽生，是為悼公。六年，吳敗齊師。齊人弒悼公，立其子簡公。九年，晉定公與吳王夫差盟，爭長於黃池，卒先吳。吳彊，陵中國。十二年，齊田常弒簡公，立其弟平公，常相之。十三年，楚滅陳。秦悼公立十四年卒，子厲共公立。孔子以悼公十二年卒。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m046-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000430","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m046-0005","start":5,"end":9,"surface":"齊臣田乞","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000431","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m046-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"孺子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000432","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m046-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"其兄","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定指代、群體或官稱；商君語為篇章指引，不當作獨立個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m046-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"陽生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000433","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m046-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000433","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m046-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000433","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m046-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000271","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m046-0049","start":49,"end":52,"surface":"晉定公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000269","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m046-0053","start":53,"end":57,"surface":"吳王夫差","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p0